# Lab 6: ReadOnly Access Test

Logged in using an IAM user with EC2 read-only permissions.

### Test

View EC2 instances:

SUCCESS

Launch EC2:

FAILED

AWS returned an AccessDenied error because the user did not have the required create permissions.

Example denied action:

ec2:CreateSecurityGroup

### Learning

Read-only permissions allow viewing resources but do not allow resource creation or modification.

